{"title":"Career Roadmap · Legal Analyst (Tech)","role":"Legal Analyst (Tech)","summary":"A Legal Analyst (Tech) supports organizations on legal, regulatory, contractual and risk issues arising from technology, digital products and data.","facts":{"Current degree":"Law – LLB / BA LLB / BBA LLB / B.Com LLB / B.Sc LLB (Integrated)","Course":"Cyber Law"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Legal Analyst (Tech) supports organizations on legal, regulatory, contractual and risk issues arising from technology, digital products and data."},{"type":"p","text":"The role combines:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Law","Technology","Compliance","Legal Research","Risk Analysis","Business Understanding"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"A Legal Analyst (Tech) may work with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Technology companies"},{"text":"IT services companies"},{"text":"SaaS companies"},{"text":"Fintech companies"},{"text":"E-commerce companies"},{"text":"Cybersecurity companies"},{"text":"Consulting firms"},{"text":"Banks and financial institutions"},{"text":"Legal-tech companies"},{"text":"Corporate legal departments"},{"text":"Privacy and compliance teams"},{"text":"Technology-focused law firms"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Typical responsibilities include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Technology-law research"},{"text":"Contract review"},{"text":"Data-protection analysis"},{"text":"Cyber-law research"},{"text":"Digital-platform compliance"},{"text":"Technology risk assessment"},{"text":"Privacy-policy review"},{"text":"Vendor-risk analysis"},{"text":"Regulatory monitoring"},{"text":"Legal documentation"},{"text":"Compliance tracking"},{"text":"Supporting legal teams with technology-related matters"},{"text":"This is generally an analytical and advisory role, rather than a courtroom-only career."}]}]},{"heading":"Career Pathway","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["Class 12","Integra