Software"},{"text":"SaaS"},{"text":"Cloud services"},{"text":"Data storage"},{"text":"Cybersecurity"},{"text":"Digital identity"},{"text":"Authentication"},{"text":"Encryption"},{"text":"Cookies"},{"text":"APIs"},{"text":"Data processing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Cyber Law & Data Protection"},{"type":"p","text":"This becomes the core specialization stage."},{"type":"h","text":"Cyber Law"},{"type":"p","text":"Study areas such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cyber offences"},{"text":"Unauthorized access"},{"text":"Data-related offences"},{"text":"Identity theft"},{"text":"Online fraud"},{"text":"Digital evidence"},{"text":"Cybercrime investigation"},{"text":"Intermediary-related issues"},{"text":"Electronic records"},{"text":"Digital signatures"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data Protection"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Personal data"},{"text":"Sensitive information concepts"},{"text":"Data processing"},{"text":"Consent"},{"text":"Purpose limitation"},{"text":"Data minimization"},{"text":"Data security"},{"text":"Data retention"},{"text":"Data subject rights"},{"text":"Breach response"},{"text":"Cross-border data considerations"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For India-focused practice, students should study the current Digital Personal Data Protection framework and associated rules/notifications, rather than relying only on older privacy-law materials."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — Technology Law"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop deeper understanding of:"},{"type":"h","text":"Internet Law"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Intermediary liability"},{"text":"Online platforms"},{"text":"Content moderation"},{"text":"E-commerce"},{"text":"Digital advertising"},{"text":"Online contracts"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Intellectual Property"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Software copyright"},{"text":"Software licensing"},{"text":"Open-source licensing"},{"text":"Trade secrets"},{"text":"Technology licensing"},{"text":"Database-related IP issu