ship"]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest candidate is not simply a lawyer who knows that technology exists. The ideal profile is someone who can understand a technology product, identify the data and legal implications, interpret the applicable law, analyze contractual and regulatory risks, communicate findings to technical/business teams, and translate legal requirements into practical compliance actions."},{"type":"h","text":"Core formula:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Law","Technology Fundamentals","Cyber/Privacy Law","Contracts","Risk Analysis","Legal Research","AI Governance = Strong Tech Legal Analyst Profile"],"sep":"+"}]}]}